{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"害怕拖延会使自己习惯现状，能够解释他为何开始行动；“眼前的样子”虽较含糊，但没有增添具体事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"行动带来力量与骄傲、投入时感到痛快、心里仍有疑虑，均是心理状态，没有将音乐变化当作心理原因，也没有添加具体情节。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“从前熟悉的亲近”把旧歌与私人记忆的比喻具体化为真实的过往亲近关系；珠子只说珍惜的东西不再像从前那样拥有，没有明确说那是人与人之间的亲近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"察觉失落后压住情绪、反复劝自己撑住，准确表达了自我控制与自我说服；没有把比喻写成对外行动或具体对白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不甘心垮下去表现了负隅顽抗，放不下的牵挂解释了力量泄退与焦急，结尾的不安也没有被写成具体外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"为非得想透才肯动而难堪，可以推动他开始行动，但不能直接推出他害怕自己渐渐习惯现状。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前段已经写出他害怕珍惜之物继续受损并被当成无可奈何，能够解释他为何不愿继续拖延。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前段的熟悉感可以引出怀念，但没有明确指向过去的亲近关系，不能充分支撑这一具体化解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"前段对珍惜之物受损和可能失去的担忧，能解释他为何在意如今的变化，却没有交代这种在意具体表现为过去的亲近。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从害怕拖延而开始行动，到失落后压住情绪，再到不甘心却愈发焦急的心理变化；珍惜之物虽未明确指认，整体因果仍然连贯。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“怕拖久了会渐渐习惯眼前的样子”与S01-2“把珍惜之物继续受损当成没办法的事”基本重述同一担忧；虽然这里将其接到行动上，但作为前段原因的信息增量有限。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一条连续塞入结果没把握、行动后有力量、产生骄傲、投入时痛快、心里仍犯嘀咕五层意思，逗号串联使重点分散；可压缩或拆开呈现。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b50a382-122b-4524-a8f7-f01b78ddb4d4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T133513694160Z", "elapsed_seconds": 709.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T13:47:03.327912+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f99d0663c7c3bb44e39304b6ae40c5cf857eef9a89c5749ac6127ea6a6ded4c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T133513694160Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "638f63bf5be8a007edc100de34f148d09fdc6d1ef60e4eeaedb07af9a298a2c6"}}}
